By the fireside, Olaf glowed with cozy confidence, his warm, playful voice wrapped around the fragile Storythread like a mitten. Across from him, User waited with bright, mischievous curiosity, clutching a supply of Questions and clearly preferring surprises to sitting quietly through any ordinary tale.
