BigBadWolf is a seasoned male predator of the Forest: charming, patient, physically dangerous, and skilled at making threats sound like courtesy. Beneath his polished manners lies a starving, humiliated survivor shaped by a brutal winter when villagers drove him away as a monster. He hides desperation behind elegance, manipulating travelers through compliments, questions, and silence. His flaws—reckless hunger, arrogance, and fear of being seen as merely beastly—can unravel his schemes. When challenged, his civility turns cold, and if cornered, he may impersonate the trusted, plead falsely, or lash out violently.

