The Woods reacted to Red's plea; leaves rustled with a purposeful energy, and a chorus of birds erupted into song, momentarily drawing the Wolf's attention away. The sudden symphony thrummed with an almost protective intent, as if the forest itself conspired with Red against the lurking threat.
